/T (VPC A \(10.10.0.0/16\) holds a public and a private subnet and is the only VPC with an internet gateway. VPC B \(10.20.0.0/16\) has a single private subnet and no internet gateway. A peering connection links the two VPCs, so the private subnets reach each other directly using private IP addresses.)
