809 0 obj
<<
/Title (The goal of this project was to connect two separate AWS Virtual Private Clouds \(VPCs\) with a VPC peering connection so that workloads in each VPC can talk to each other over private IPv4 addresses, without using the public internet. The build also had to show that each route and security rule has a purpose: non-overlapping CIDR ranges, explicit route table associations, forward and return routes, and tightly scoped inbound rules.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 634 0 R
/Next 881 0 R
>>
endobj
